     "html": "<p style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap\" class=\"rte-large\"><em>All notes and resources on this page have been carefully compiled by our dedicated volunteers, who stand by our mission and are passionate about making learning accessible. Please note that course materials and curricula may vary by state and school.</em></p><p style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap\" class=\"rte-large\"><em>These resources are provided for reference only—we are not responsible for any instances of plagiarism. Please refrain from downloading or sharing them outside of our organization.</em></p>"
